# Everybody Can Cook — "Everybody / can cook." where every letter flips in 3D
# (two stacked Animated.Texts, rotateX/translateY/opacity) with a staggered
# withDelay+withSpring; tapping anywhere resets and replays the stagger.
# What this test covers: the first play, a replay after the animation has
# settled, taps in different spots of the full-screen pressable, a tap in the
# middle of the stagger (reset to 0 while delayed springs are pending), and
# a burst of rapid taps that repeatedly reset/restart all 18 letter springs.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/everybody-can-cook"
wait "text" "E" 10000
wait 1500
press 201 437
wait 1800
press 201 437
wait 1800
press 100 250
wait 1800
press 300 700
wait 1800
# Interrupt mid-stagger.
press 201 437
wait 200
press 201 437
wait 1800
# Rapid replay burst.
press 201 437 --count 8 --interval-ms 60
wait 2000
press 201 437
wait 300
press 201 437
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 5000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\" id=\"xmark\""
wait 1500
